        borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(AppSpacing.xxxl),
      ),
      elevation: 0,
      color: AppColors.cardSurface,
      child: Padding(
        padding: const EdgeInsets.all(AppSpacing.xxxl),
        child: Column(
          mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
          crossAxisAlignment: CrossAxisAlignment.start,
